<Layout title="About · People of GraphQL"><section class="wrap page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE PROJECT</p><h1>Technology has<br /><em>a human side.</em></h1></section><div class="article-body about-copy"><p>People of GraphQL is a place for the people behind the tools, the specifications, and the conversations that shape GraphQL.</p><h2>Stories worth telling</h2><p>Our interviews explore personal journeys: how people found their way into the community, what keeps them curious, and what they have learned along the way.</p><h2>A little recognition goes a long way</h2><p>GraphQL Stars celebrates 52 contributors each year. A face, a name, and a snapshot of their contribution — a chance to discover the people helping the ecosystem grow.</p><p class="notice">This site is an initial design preview. The interviews currently use clearly labelled fictional sample content. The 2026 Stars gallery features our 52 selected contributors.</p><a class="back" href="/stories/">Explore the stories</a></div></Layout>
